{"id":"028fc68190b10b4a","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-largecard2-unfoldable-cardinal.md","title":"ZFC Largecard2 Unfoldable Cardinal","display":"df-zfc-largecard2-unfoldable-cardinal — ZFC Largecard2 Unfoldable Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-largecard2-unfoldable-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-largecard2-unfoldable-cardinal"],"display":"df-zfc-largecard2-unfoldable-cardinal — ZFC Largecard2 Unfoldable Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-largecard2-unfoldable-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-largecard2-unfoldable-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-largecard2-unfoldable-cardinal — ZFC Largecard2 Unfoldable Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,M,N,j,\\theta\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,M,N,j,\\theta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}\\)</span> is ZFC without the Power Set axiom, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_{\\in}(M)\">\\(\\mathfrak M_{\\in}(M)\\)</span> is the canonical membership structure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> are the cardinal and ordinal predicates (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\\)</span> is the transitive-set predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span> is the elementary-embedding predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaModel}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaModel}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is defined here</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2UnfoldableCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2UnfoldableCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KappaModel}_S(M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathfrak M_{\\in}(M)\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}\\land M\\approx\\kappa\\land\\kappa\\in M\\land M^{&lt;\\kappa}\\subseteq M\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KappaModel}_S(M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathfrak M_{\\in}(M)\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}\\land M\\approx\\kappa\\land\\kappa\\in M\\land M^{&lt;\\kappa}\\subseteq M\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}unfoldable\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2UnfoldableCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\to\\forall M\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{KappaModel}_S(M,\\kappa)\\to\\exists N,j\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(N)\\land\\mathfrak M_{\\in}(N)\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathfrak M_{\\in}(M),\\mathfrak M_{\\in}(N))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\land\\theta&lt;j(\\kappa))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}unfoldable\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2UnfoldableCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\to\\forall M\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{KappaModel}_S(M,\\kappa)\\to\\exists N,j\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(N)\\land\\mathfrak M_{\\in}(N)\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathfrak M_{\\in}(M),\\mathfrak M_{\\in}(N))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\land\\theta&lt;j(\\kappa))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The quantified <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is explicitly a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-model of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}\\)</span>; fixing every ordinal below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> and moving <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> replaces the previously undeclared critical-point operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolve